# Prettier should only ever look at files we hand-write. Without this it also
# walks built output (dist/, docs/dist/), which is minified/generated and
# will never match our formatting rules — `prettier . --check` would fail on
# someone else's bundler output instead of our source.
**/dist/**
node_modules/**
coverage/**
test-results/**
playwright-report/**
.astro/**
docs/.astro/**
# Lockfiles are kept as text (see .gitattributes) but not reformatted.
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json
# The changelog is written by hand; Prettier would wrap the prose.
CHANGELOG.md